WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.250
In the repair list, click the purple button at the top right to
create an order.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:09.250
The form guides you through the details one step at a time.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:14.042
Enter the customer's phone number in the first field, then
check their name.

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:18.667
Select an existing customer from the suggestions when
appropriate.

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.667
These are fictional demo details.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:25.500
Choose the device category, brand and model.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.583
Enter the serial number or I M E I from the device.

00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:35.167
Always check scanned text; a model name does not confirm its
specifications.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:39.750
Select the reported problem and enter any repair items and
quote.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.292
These fields record the customer's request.

00:00:43.292 --> 00:00:47.958
They do not replace inspection or the customer's approval to
repair.

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:53.083
Review the customer, device, problem, accessories and quote.

00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:55.833
You may skip the signature button.

00:00:55.833 --> 00:01:00.833
A signature does not mean payment was received or the device
was returned.

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:05.500
Tick the confirmation box and use the save and preview button
below.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:09.708
After saving, open the order or print the intake receipt.

00:01:09.708 --> 00:01:13.292
Continue tracking this repair in the same order.
